{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","凛冬战歌"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","凛冬の歌"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤暴风雪降低对方急速并造成持续伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","吹雪を起こし、敵全体の速度バフを解除し、持続的にダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，寒冬伴随阿尔娜降临战场，降低除阿尔娜外的所有单位40急速和2格射程。\n主动释放时，阿尔娜发出战吼引发暴风雪，暴风雪将清空所有敌人的急速增益且每0.5秒对全场敌人造成40% + 6% ATK伤害，持续8秒。在此期间，暴风雪将暂时屏蔽自身和“凛冬战士”的痛觉，当其受到伤害时，会在后续10秒内逐渐恢复本次失去的50% + 5%生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、自身と共に凛冬がフィールドに降臨。自身以外のユニットの速度-40、射程-2\nアクティブ効果：咆哮を上げ、8秒間の吹雪を起こす。吹雪は敵全体の速度バフをすべて解除し、0.5秒ごとにフィールド上の敵全体に40% + 6% ATKのダメージを与える。吹雪の期間中、自身と「凛冬の戦士」の痛覚が遮断され、ダメージを受けた後の10秒間、受けたダメージの50% + 5%分のHPを徐々に回復"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":91,"end":96,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":162,"end":167,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":109,"end":114,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":180,"end":185,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":88,"end":100,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":106,"end":118,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至45% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが45% + 6% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至50% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/