娜处于同排的一名友军将晋升为“凛冬战士”，“凛冬战士”免疫“凛冬战歌”带来的急速减益效果，并且永久提高15% + 1.5%生命上限。\n主动释放时，阿尔娜使用长矛穿刺敌人造成340% + 40% ATK伤害，并为自己和“凛冬战士”恢复伤害量100% + 10%的生命。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","配置時、自身と同じ横列にいる味方1体は「凛冬の戦士」になる。「凛冬の戦士」は「凛冬の歌」による速度減少効果を無効化し、永続的にHP上限+15% + 1.5%\nアクティブ効果：槍で敵1体を貫き、340% + 40% ATKのダメージを与え、自身と「凛冬の戦士」のHPを与えたダメージ×100% + 10%分回復"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":60,"end":67,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":96,"end":102,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":129,"end":135,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":71,"end":78,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":100,"end":106,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":145,"end":151,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":92,"end":106,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":96,"end":110,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが360% + 40% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至380% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが380% + 40% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{